    "date": 1723526436,
    "caption": "🥳 Hero Training is back!\n\nAstana Hub and Draper University are launching a third batch of a joint program for tech startups in Silicon Valley – HERO TRAINING!\n\n🤩 This year as part of the Hero Training program, startups will have the opportunity to undergo a 5-week offline acceleration with leading tech entrepreneurs and experts in Silicon Valley with the chance to live and build networks on the Draper University campus. \n\n🔥The program includes workshops and sessions on business modeling and entrepreneurship, pitch practices, networking events, and demo days with field experts and VC investors. \n\n⚡️ This year 10 best startup projects from Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Uzbekistan, Azerbaijan, Mongolia, Tajikistan, and Turkiye can take part in the program! \n \n🌎 Unlock your startup’s potential with the Hero Training program from Astana Hub and Draper University! \n\n⏳ Deadline: September 1, 2024.\n\n🔗 Hurry and submit your application via the link in the bio.",
